values ('glossary_term', 'adit', 'en', 'Adit', 'A horizontal passage or tunnel driven into the side of a hill or mountain to access a mine. Unlike a shaft, an adit is driven at or near the surface level and does not require hoisting equipment.', 'Mining Structures', 'draft', 'MineGuard field app reference content (data.js); no qualified sign-off recorded')
